  {
   "start": 2.29,
   "end": 3.29,
   "text": "Good morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.29,
   "end": 6.63,
   "text": "My name is Niko Arevalo and we're back today with another episode of EquiTips."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.63,
   "end": 8.63,
   "text": "Today we're joined by Jada with IC Biomedical."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.63,
   "end": 9.63,
   "text": "Hey Niko."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.63,
   "end": 10.63,
   "text": "Hey Jada, how are you today?"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.63,
   "end": 11.63,
   "text": "I'm good."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.63,
   "end": 12.63,
   "text": "How are you?"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.63,
   "end": 13.63,
   "text": "I'm doing fantastic."
  },
  {
   "start": 13.63,
   "end": 14.63,
   "text": "Thank you so much for having us today."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.63,
   "end": 15.63,
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.63,
   "end": 16.63,
   "text": "Thanks for having us as well."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.63,
   "end": 17.63,
   "text": "Of course."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.63,
   "end": 18.63,
   "text": "Well, so tell me a little bit about IC Biomedical."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.63,
   "end": 19.63,
   "text": "What do you guys do?"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.63,
   "end": 20.63,
   "text": "Yes, of course."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.63,
   "end": 25.71,
   "text": "So we specialize in making liquid nitrogen doers and our liquid withdrawal device."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.71,
   "end": 26.71,
   "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.71,
   "end": 28.83,
   "text": "So are these the liquid doers that we're talking about?"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.83,
   "end": 29.83,
   "text": "Yes, they are."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.83,
   "end": 35.89,
   "text": "So here today we have our 5-liter doers to our 50, but they are also go from 4 to 50."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.89,
   "end": 39.85,
   "text": "And on our 35 liquid doer, we have our liquid withdrawal device."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.85,
   "end": 40.85,
   "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.85,
   "end": 43.55,
   "text": "So what differentiates your products from other products in the market?"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.55,
   "end": 44.55,
   "text": "Of course."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.55,
   "end": 49.07,
   "text": "So other products on the market, you have to remove the liquid withdrawal device to fill."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.07,
   "end": 54.11,
   "text": "But with our liquid withdrawal device, you remove the spout with our built-in face"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.11,
   "end": 57.55,
   "text": "separator and attach a hose and fill."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.55,
   "end": 62.83,
   "text": "And this makes fill time quicker, it's safer, and mitigates wear and tear on the liquid"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.83,
   "end": 63.83,
   "text": "withdrawal device."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.83,
   "end": 64.83,
   "text": "Awesome."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.83,
   "end": 66.39,
   "text": "Well, sounds like a great product."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.39,
   "end": 68.15,
   "text": "And where is this all made?"
  },
  {
   "start": 68.15,
   "end": 69.63,
   "text": "It's made in America, baby."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.63,
   "end": 70.63,
   "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.63,
   "end": 71.63,
   "text": "Awesome."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.63,
   "end": 72.63,
   "text": "And where can I find such an amazing product?"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.63,
   "end": 73.63,
   "text": "You can find us at Equigash."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.63,
   "end": 74.63,
   "text": "Perfect."
  },
  {
